ata-oversight/workforce-restructuring/reductions-in-force-rif/\">U.S. Office of Personnel Management</a> (OPM)</li>\r\n            <li>Other OPM-specified federal and non-federal organizations</li>\r\n            <li>The Maryland Department of Labor, for RIFs at Maryland work locations</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n          <p>To submit a RIF notification to MD Labor, send an email to <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b5d1d9c2d1d4d9c2d4c7db98d9d4d7dac7f5d8d4c7ccd9d4dbd19bd2dac3\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"187c746f7c79746f796a763574797a776a5875796a617479767c367f776e\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>. </p>\r\n          <p> The RIF log below includes all formal notices federal agencies have submitted to MD Labor beginning in 2025, in connection with the requirements for RIFs. Prior to 2025, RIFs were not included on the posted list of dislocation events on our webpage. MD Labor did not receive any RIFs between 2015 and 2025. </p>\r\n          <h3>RIF Log</h3>\r\n          <p> <strong>Archive of RIF and other dislocation notices:</strong> </p>\r\n          <div id=\"accordion\">\r\n  <h3>Federal RIF Log</h3>\r\n<div>\r\n\t<ul>\r\n       <li><a class=\"sub\" href=\"rif2025.shtml\">2025</a></li>\r\n\t  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n \r\n          \r\n        </main>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n      \r\n</div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- End Body Content -->\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <footer id=\"mdgovFooter\" class=\"mdgov-footer-2024\">\r\n                        <div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n                            <div class=\"mdgov-footer-2024__top\">\r\n                                <div class=\"mdgov-footer-2024__agency\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"mdgov-footer-2024__agency__logo\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"https://doit.maryland.gov/Style%20Library/MD.SharePoint.ToolKit/img/logo.png\" alt=\"Maryland Logo\">\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                